\&Add a string parameter in key=value format
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-r, \-\-ref <string>\fR
\&The git reference (branch or tag) to run the workflow on
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
